OL,3,GNEWSAUnionism 'stands at a crossroads',
OL,4,ABurrows to tell UUP conference
OL,5,
OL,6,FJon Burrows will say that unionism in
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland "stands at a
OL,8,Fcrossroads" when he makes his first
OL,9,Fconference speech as Ulster Unionist
OL,10,Fleader later on Saturday.
OL,12,FThe former police officer took over as
OL,13,Fparty leader at the start of this year,
OL,14,Fafter being co-opted to Stormont as an
OL,15,Fassembly member (MLA) last summer.
OL,17,FBurrows is expected to tell delegates
OL,18,Fthat unionism "must grow its support
OL,19,Frather than simply divide the vote it
OL,20,Falready has".
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
